      241.85,
      397.19,
      265.79
    ],
    "text": "(b) to establish information technology centers for theadvancement of scientific studies;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      176.71,
      279.89,
      397.18,
      303.95
    ],
    "text": "(c) to provide self-employment opportunities forunemployed;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.87,
      318.05,
      397.2,
      341.99
    ],
    "text": "(d) to participate in social, cultural and economicdevelopment of the Country; and",
    "fonts": [
