  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      203.45,
      401.89,
      265.55
    ],
    "text": "6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, from time totime, at any general meeting of the members and by a majorityof not less than two-thirds of the members present to makerules not inconsistent with the provisions of this Act or anyother written law, on all or any of the following matters:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      279.65,
      401.88,
      303.59
    ],
    "text": "(a) the classification of members and the admission,withdrawal, resignation, expulsion of members;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      317.69,
      401.87,
      354.47
    ],
    "text": "(b) the election of office bearers, the resignation from,vacation of or removal from office of office-bearersand their powers, conduct and duties;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      181.29,
      368.45,
      401.89,
      405.23
    ],
    "text": "(c) the election of the members of the Committee ofManagement and its powers, conduct and dutiesand term of the Committee members;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      419.33,
      401.87,
      481.43
    ],
    "text": "(d) the procedure to be observed at and the summoningand holding of meetings of the Committee ofManagement or sub Committee and of the time,places, notices and agenda of such meetings, thequorum thereof and the conduct of business thereof;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      181.29,
      495.53,
      401.86,
      532.19
    ],
    "text": "(e) the powers, conduct, duties and functions of thevarious officers, agents and servants of theCorporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      182.85,
      546.29,
      401.9,
      583.07
    ],
    "text": "(f) the administration and management of the porpertyof the Corporation, the custody of its fund and themaintenance and audit of its accounts; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      597.05,
      401.86,
      621.11
    ],
    "text": "(g) the management of the affairs of the Corporationand the accomplishment of its objects.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      635.21,
      401.9,
      671.87
    ],
    "text": "(2) Any rule made by the Corporation may be amended,altered, added to or rescinded at a like meeting and in likemanner as a rule made under subsection (1).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
